      "contentsFinding": [
        "KnightCharacter.blend is one complete 480-vertex skinned character with a 31-bone armature and twelve creator actions.",
        "Helmet3 and the shoulder pads are separate static assets, not rigged parts of KnightCharacter; assembling them would require authored placement.",
        "The creator mesh has 31 vertices with more than four influences and two individual weights over 1, so a browser glTF conversion must preserve extra influence sets and still normalize the invalid weights."
      ]
